<body>
    <h1>21.08.2025</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Attendees: Niels Borg (chair), Didi Kunz, Davy Van Deursen, Pete=
rs Jan-Philipp, Nico Peters, Johan Nyman, Tuomo Kulomaa, Thomas Probst, Mat=
t Starzak, Christian Gogstad Eide, Ivan Maretic, Markus Nygard, Bruce Beauv=
illain, Colin Buchtmann, Mike James Knight, Vincent Trussart, Jason MacNama=
ra, Victoria Nece, Stian Kongsvik, Petri Karlsson, Ryan MacKenna, Ben Shepp=
ard, Paola Sunna</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Agenda:</p>
<ol>
 <li>Post-summer status&nbsp;</li>
 <li>Spec release&nbsp;</li>
 <li>API - where are we?&nbsp;</li>
 <li>IBC Booth=20
  <ol>
   <li>Who can demo?&nbsp;</li>
   <li>Collateral - what do we need?</li>
  </ol></li>
</ol>
<p>Meeting Notes:</p>
<ul>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">SRG (newcomer) interested in OGraf </span></=
li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">TV2.DK, high interest from many vendors&nbsp=
;</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true"><span data-teams=3D"true">GV is considering =
the integration of OGraf in GV AMPP, waiting to get a more consolidated ver=
sion of the API&nbsp;</span></span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Preview/Thumbnails will be added to the mani=
fest as optional; default standards supported (GIF, jpeg,webp, png); more c=
omplex format will be handled using the vendor's&nbsp; features;; thumbnail=
s could be generated on the fly but this could have an impact on the render=
er performances </span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Vers1 of the spec will be ready in time for =
IBC</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Work on API (controller) will be resumed aft=
er IBC; a draft (unstable) version available on github branch; currently ba=
sed on REST API (no web socket)</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">To be sent via the mailing list by Paola and=
 Niels: updated demo workflow, rota_demopod at the EBU booth, EBU booth/dme=
o pod layout</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Demo: editing to be removed;"import" require=
s efforts to be implemented; (Loopic) can import Lottie files;OGraf goal: g=
raphics definition -&gt; renderer and less interoperability among creators;=
 OGraf/Claude AI from BBC to be added</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">No need to print the spec, QR to point to th=
e spec</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Ideally it would be good to cover different =
genres (e.g., elections, news, sport) in the demo</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Graphics packages for the demo to be sent to=
 Niels and Paola by Wednesday next week; demo script will be built around t=
hem<br></span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">GDD integration will be included in vers 1.1=
; no time now; Superfly will open it as "issue" in github; this transition =
shouldn't break anything, technically feasible but not time currently.</spa=
n></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true"><a href=3D"http://Softpix.io" class=3D"exter=
nal-link" rel=3D"nofollow">Softpix.io</a>: soon in their blog, articles abo=
ut HTML graphics generation and integration in NRCS will be posted</span></=
li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Still some issues on github that will be add=
ressed in v1.1</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Open source meetup at the EBU booth, Niel's =
presentation (<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://tech.ebu.ch/events=
/2025/open-source-meetup-ebu-ibc-2025" rel=3D"nofollow">https://tech.ebu.ch=
/events/2025/open-source-meetup-ebu-ibc-2025</a>)</span></li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p><span data-teams=3D"true">Actions:</span></p>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">To be sent via the mailing list by Paola and=
 Niels: updated demo workflow, rota_demopod at the EBU booth, EBU booth/dem=
o pod layout</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">All: Graphics packages for the demo to be se=
nt to Niels and Paola by Wednesday next week; demo script will be built aro=
und them</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Niels: Demo: editing to be removed;"import" =
requires efforts to be implemented; (Loopic) can import Lottie files;OGraf =
goal: graphics definition -&gt; renderer and less interoperability among cr=
eators; OGraf/Claude AI from BBC to be added</span></li>
 <li><span data-teams=3D"true">Ben to send the Claude demo details to Niels=
</span></li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
